//! Brand logos for the agent-settings provider cards.
//!
//! Lucide-flavored stroke icons (in `icons.rs`) are wrong for the
//! AI provider avatars because Anthropic / OpenAI / Google / GitHub
//! / OpenCode ship filled-path logos with their own viewBoxes —
//! lucide approximations (Sparkles / Component / Diamond …) don't
//! read as the real brand. Path strings here are copied verbatim
//! from `apps/web/src/components/icons/*-logo.tsx` so the native
//! shell renders the same glyph as the TS app.
//!
//! OpenCode's logo is a multi-element terminal (rect + line + 3
//! circles + chevron path) so it's drawn via `paint_opencode_logo`
//! using the primitive backend ops rather than a single filled
//! path — same shape as the TS source.

use crate::{Color, Point2D, Rect, RenderBackend};

